hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"154","[AI-translation] Hujikinga kwa Allah naye, kwa kutamka kujikinga kwa Allah na shetani aliyelaaniwa. [Dhidi ya wasiwasi wa shetani]"
"155","[AI-translation] Adhana huadhiniwa. [Adhana sikioni mwa kulia mwa mtoto mchanga]"
"156","[AI-translation] Dhikr husemwa na Qur'an husomwa. [Akiwa na dhiki na wasiwasi]"
